cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CANOPI: Certified Canonicalization for Prompt-Injection Defense"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for the paper "Certified Canonicalization: A
  Detector-Agnostic Defense against Prompt-Injection Obfuscation." Includes the
  canonicalization package, the decision-invariance certificate checker, the
  defense-aware adaptive attacker, the B1-B8 benchmark suite, and a one-run
  reproducibility notebook.
